  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_00",
      "hash64": "D1EDE1F9BC47230F",
      "text": "Vaya, vaya... Veo en ti un pasado fascinante.\\nSe nota que tu alma ha viajado mucho...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_01",
      "hash64": "D1EDE0F9BC47215C",
      "text": "Puedo estudiar tu SmartRotom para observar tus\\nvidas pasadas mediante la Rotometría.\\c\\n¿Quieres probar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_02",
      "hash64": "D1EDE3F9BC472675",
      "text": "Hmm... Quizá sea mejor dejarlo, después de\\ntodo. Algo me dice que no terminas de fiarte.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_03",
      "hash64": "D1EDE2F9BC4724C2",
      "text": "Tu pasado... ¡está pasando frente a mis ojos!\\nVeo una vida que viviste en... ¿Qué lugar es este?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_028_select_a",
      "hash64": "35D0BFAD69D0E96D",
      "text": "¿Kanto?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_028_select_b",
      "hash64": "35D0BCAD69D0E454",
      "text": "¿Galar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_028_select_c",
      "hash64": "35D0BDAD69D0E607",
      "text": "¿Sinnoh?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_028_select_d",
      "hash64": "35D0BAAD69D0E0EE",
      "text": "¿Hisui?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_028_select_e",
      "hash64": "35D0BBAD69D0E2A1",
      "text": "Mejor lo dejamos...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_04",
      "hash64": "D1EDDDF9BC471C43",
      "text": "¡Ay, lo estoy viendo! Sí, sí, lo veo muy claro...\\nEn otra vida...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_a",
      "hash64": "036CE3FECEFF3FC2",
      "text": "¡Viajaste por todo Kanto junto a tu compañero\\nPokémon, que te seguía a todas partes!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_b",
      "hash64": "036CE2FECEFF3E0F",
      "text": "¡Viajaste por la región de Galar e hiciste frente a\\ninnumerables desafíos con la ayuda de tus fieles\\r\\nPokémon, capaces de dinamaxizarse!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_c",
      "hash64": "036CE1FECEFF3C5C",
      "text": "¡Viajaste por la región de Sinnoh, exploraste sus\\nGrutas del Subsuelo y causaste sensación junto\\r\\na tus Pokémon en los Superconcursos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_d",
      "hash64": "036CE0FECEFF3AA9",
      "text": "¡Viajaste por la región de Hisui, embarcándote\\nen una aventura guiada por un misterioso móvil\\r\\ncaído del cielo!...\\c\\nUn momento... ¿Hisui? ¿Dónde queda eso?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_05",
      "hash64": "D1EDDCF9BC471A90",
      "text": "Voy a diseñarte una funda para el SmartRotom\\ninspirada en esos recuerdos de tu vida pasada.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_06",
      "hash64": "D1EDDFF9BC471FA9",
      "text": "¡Tacháaan!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_07",
      "hash64": "D1EDDEF9BC471DF6",
      "text": "Ya está terminada. ¡Espero que te guste!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_028_system_a",
      "hash64": "4AF36B673E33A1D0",
      "text": "Has obtenido una [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Funda Pikavee[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
